00:04:43.328 --> 00:04:44.362
- I honestly think things have been

00:04:44.362 --> 00:04:45.475
going pretty smoothly.

00:04:45.475 --> 00:04:47.486
I feel like we've divvied
up everything pretty equally

00:04:47.486 --> 00:04:50.040
and we've gotten along really well.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.085
- I burnt the onions.

00:04:51.085 --> 00:04:52.013
- Oh my god (laughs).

00:04:52.013 --> 00:04:53.930
- (laughs) We can't use this.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:55.390
(both laugh)

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.632
- Sorry, I tried a new
recipe that I'm not used to.

00:04:57.632 --> 00:04:58.584
Actually, I'm gonna do that.

00:04:58.584 --> 00:05:00.460
Okay, fax the original recipe.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.477
- Guys, where's the vodka?

00:05:02.477 --> 00:05:07.193
(triumphant orchestral music)

00:05:07.193 --> 00:05:08.465
- Are you supposed to be putting them

00:05:08.465 --> 00:05:10.137
