00:05:10.137 --> 00:05:12.528
- Yeah, why not?
- Oh, maybe not.

00:05:12.528 --> 00:05:13.888
(laughs)
- Wait, what?

00:05:18.482 --> 00:05:21.101
- Everyone's gonna get drunk.

00:05:21.101 --> 00:05:22.205
Just kidding (laughs).

00:05:27.908 --> 00:05:30.458
- I hate everything right now.
(Kane laughs)

00:05:30.458 --> 00:05:31.920
- [Voiceover] Do you know
what waits behind you,

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.197
