00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.574
- Yes, and they are made
of spinach and artichoke,

00:06:14.574 --> 00:06:17.277
and parmesan, and mozzarella.
- Mozzarella.

00:06:17.277 --> 00:06:18.414
- Is there egg also?

00:06:18.414 --> 00:06:19.761
- Yeah, there is egg.

00:06:19.761 --> 00:06:20.550
- That's like a given.

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:21.665
- That's the main ingredient.

00:06:21.665 --> 00:06:22.663
- There's no crust.

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:25.468
- They are crustless.

00:06:25.468 --> 00:06:27.186
(everyone laughs)

00:06:27.186 --> 00:06:28.384
- Yeah, they're crustless.

00:06:32.982 --> 00:06:35.072
- So, this is salad.

00:06:35.072 --> 00:06:37.463
- I'm trying to get the
rest of the food together

00:06:37.463 --> 00:06:39.158
