00:07:09.391 --> 00:07:10.947
- What do you think of the salmon, guys?

00:07:10.947 --> 00:07:11.783
- It's really great.

00:07:11.783 --> 00:07:12.828
- Fucking delicious.
- It's really great.

00:07:12.828 --> 00:07:13.919
- Glad you like it.

00:07:13.919 --> 00:07:15.242
- It's nice and subtle.

00:07:15.242 --> 00:07:16.403
- It's right on.

00:07:16.403 --> 00:07:17.564
- This is a lot of food.

00:07:17.564 --> 00:07:18.645
