00:07:20.415 --> 00:07:22.366
- I am so proud of these.

00:07:22.366 --> 00:07:25.895
I have never used a little
pastry frosting thing before.

00:07:25.895 --> 00:07:27.729
- My friend had invited me over one time.

00:07:27.729 --> 00:07:28.751
She's like, "Dinner's at five."

00:07:28.751 --> 00:07:29.796
I was like, "What?"

00:07:29.796 --> 00:07:31.050
