00:07:41.266 --> 00:07:42.920
- Oh, there's a game.
- Yeah.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:46.615
(laughs)

00:07:48.269 --> 00:07:49.723
- You can't use (mumbles).
(several people laugh)

00:07:49.723 --> 00:07:51.784
