00:07:51.784 --> 00:07:54.329
- Oh, wake the fuck up.

00:07:54.329 --> 00:07:55.444
- Yeah!

00:07:55.444 --> 00:07:56.814
- Okay, Briana.

00:07:56.814 --> 00:07:57.928
- It's not time yet, Kane.

00:07:57.928 --> 00:07:59.089
(Kane laughs)
- Too hot.

00:07:59.089 --> 00:08:01.790
(several people laugh)

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:02.683
- Okay.

00:08:02.683 --> 00:08:03.728
You're feeling it.

00:08:03.728 --> 00:08:05.051
You're feeling the drinks, right?

00:08:05.051 --> 00:08:07.136
- Yeah, well you're
definitely feeling the drinks.

00:08:07.136 --> 00:08:09.858
- There were like four more
courses than I thought.

00:08:09.858 --> 00:08:10.666
I thought it was just quiche,

00:08:10.666 --> 00:08:11.780
