00:08:23.106 --> 00:08:24.193
- [Multiple people] Thank
you so much for coming.

00:08:24.193 --> 00:08:25.231
- [Multiple people] Thanks for having us.

00:08:25.231 --> 00:08:26.421
That is very adult, that's true.

00:08:26.421 --> 00:08:27.745
- Buh-bye.

